First, I need to understand the conditions properly. Let me rephrase the conditions. For each element at position i (from 2 to n-1), a_i must be <= max(a_{i-1}, a_{i+1}). Wait, but that's a bit tricky. So for example, if a_i is 3, then either the left neighbor is >=3 or the right neighbor is >=3. But how does this affect the possible values of the array?

